Article 3 (Persons Entitled to Apply for Creation, etc. of Family Relationship Registers) An application for creation, etc. of a family relationship register may be filed by any of the following persons or the person's legal representative:
1. A person determined to be a victim pursuant to Article 5 (2) of the Act;
2. A person determined to be a bereaved family member pursuant to Article 5 (2) of the Act;
3. A person who has received a decision of the Committee concerning Article 5 (2) 7 of the Act.
